<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.159" end="00:00:05.120" style="s2">This is the hundth time you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.360" end="00:00:07.120" style="s2">threatened me with suicide to stop the</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.120" end="00:00:08.880" style="s2">divorce. I&#39;m not backing down anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.120" end="00:00:10.480" style="s2">Back then, you climbed into my bed and</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.880" end="00:00:12.880" style="s2">forced me to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.480" end="00:00:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shen, who&#39;s in your bed, Mr. Shen?</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.880" end="00:00:16.480" style="s2">What exactly is your relationship with</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.400" end="00:00:17.039" style="s2">her? Excuse me. Is this woman your</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.480" end="00:00:18.720" style="s2">girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.039" end="00:00:23.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you pushed Ching Yen down the</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.720" end="00:00:23.080" style="s2">stairs trying to kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.119" end="00:00:26.000" style="s2">When you failed to harm her, you use</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.720" end="00:00:28.480" style="s2">suicide to threaten me into staying</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:31.119" style="s2">married. So vicious. I will never let</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.480" end="00:00:32.399" style="s2">you be my wife again.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.119" end="00:00:35.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t I going through lightning</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.399" end="00:00:38.480" style="s2">tribulation? Where am I?</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.360" end="00:00:42.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I ascend to the higher realm?</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.480" end="00:00:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the divorce agreement. Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.879" end="00:00:46.480" style="s2">From now on, we have nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.640" end="00:00:49.960" style="s2">each other. As compensation, I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.480" end="00:00:49.960" style="s2">you 10 million.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.320" end="00:00:53.120" style="s2">What kind of talisman is this? I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.680" end="00:00:55.039" style="s2">never seen anything like it. I am the</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.120" end="00:00:56.879" style="s2">cultivation grandmaster, a talisman</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.039" end="00:01:00.079" style="s2">prodigy. Don&#39;t think you can use a</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.879" end="00:01:02.239" style="s2">talisman to harm me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.079" end="00:01:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly,</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.239" end="00:01:09.320" style="s2">even if you tear up the check, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.320" end="00:01:09.320" style="s2">useless. This divorce is happening,</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:19.040" style="s2">brother. I see a dark aura on your</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.840" end="00:01:22.530" style="s2">forehead in energy clinging to you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.040" end="00:01:24.550" style="s2">A bloody calamity seems to be coming.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.530" end="00:01:24.550" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.640" end="00:01:31.320" style="s2">Luly, don&#39;t think playing dumb. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.600" end="00:01:31.320" style="s2">get you out of this divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.840" end="00:01:59.000" style="s2">What did I tell you? I said you had a</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.799" end="00:01:59.000" style="s2">bloody calamity, didn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.760" end="00:02:33.440" style="s2">Because of one woman, you end up</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.440" end="00:02:36.480" style="s2">crippled in both legs. Your company goes</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.440" end="00:02:38.080" style="s2">bankrupt and you die a miserable death.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.480" end="00:02:38.480" style="s2">What kind of ultimate unlucky bastard is</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.080" end="00:02:40.560" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.480" end="00:02:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say,</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.560" end="00:02:44.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; brother? Your fate&#39;s not looking good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.480" end="00:02:45.519" style="s2">Want to defy fate and change destiny?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.400" end="00:02:48.239" style="s2">I&#39;m the cultivation grandmaster. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.519" end="00:02:50.480" style="s2">metaphysics master. Not 2,998. Just 9998</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.239" end="00:02:53.480" style="s2">spirit stones. 998 out. You can&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.480" end="00:02:53.480" style="s2">scammed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.720" end="00:03:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, don&#39;t let the wounds touch</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.000" end="00:03:04.800" style="s2">water. Thanks. Hang on. Go get that</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.440" end="00:03:06.080" style="s2">one&#39;s head checked.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.800" end="00:03:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The patients already had a full body</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.080" end="00:03:09.360" style="s2">exam. The brain, nothing wrong was found</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.480" end="00:03:12.720" style="s2">at all.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.360" end="00:03:14.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.720" end="00:03:15.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If there&#39;s nothing wrong with her brain,</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.080" end="00:03:16.239" style="s2">then how how could she be like a</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.360" end="00:03:17.519" style="s2">completely different person? Even the</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.239" end="00:03:19.519" style="s2">way she talks is all weird.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.519" end="00:03:23.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The patient talks weird, maybe she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.519" end="00:03:23.000" style="s2">just plain nasty.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.680" end="00:03:32.239" style="s2">Ruined by a woman, crippled legs,</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.920" end="00:03:34.400" style="s2">company bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.239" end="00:03:35.760" style="s2">In the end, a miserable death.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.400" end="00:03:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ly, what you said to me just now? What</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.760" end="00:03:38.560" style="s2">exactly did you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.480" end="00:03:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junway,</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.560" end="00:03:44.560" style="s2">bro.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.200" end="00:03:47.519" style="s2">Junior way, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.560" end="00:03:48.879" style="s2">Ly, you jinx, why are you still here? If</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.519" end="00:03:50.000" style="s2">it weren&#39;t for you, how would my brother</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.879" end="00:03:52.239" style="s2">have gotten hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.000" end="00:03:55.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He crashed into it himself. What&#39;s that</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.239" end="00:03:55.599" style="s2">got to do with me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.680" end="00:04:08.159" style="s2">What a pitiful woman. Deceived body and</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.840" end="00:04:10.319" style="s2">soul by a man. Caught a bunch of dirty</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.159" end="00:04:12.319" style="s2">diseases. Company bankrupt. Her last bit</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.319" end="00:04:13.840" style="s2">of treatment money stolen by a man. In</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.319" end="00:04:14.879" style="s2">the end, she jumped to her death in</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.840" end="00:04:17.759" style="s2">despair.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.879" end="00:04:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? You dare curse me? I</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.759" end="00:04:21.759" style="s2">didn&#39;t say anything. Who cursed you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.440" end="00:04:21.759" style="s2">You.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.639" end="00:04:26.400" style="s2">Not just a tragic fate. Her brain</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.560" end="00:04:28.160" style="s2">doesn&#39;t work either. Whatever.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.400" end="00:04:30.400" style="s2">Considering how pitiful you are once</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.160" end="00:04:32.400" style="s2">you&#39;re dead. I&#39;ll make sure to deliver</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.400" end="00:04:34.400" style="s2">your soul properly so your next life is</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.400" end="00:04:38.080" style="s2">safe and smooth.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.400" end="00:04:41.360" style="s2">Bro, did you hear what she just said?</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.080" end="00:04:45.199" style="s2">What? Juda, are you too tired hearing</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.360" end="00:04:47.520" style="s2">things? Miss Lou didn&#39;t say anything.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.199" end="00:04:49.040" style="s2">Could it be what I heard was Li&#39;s inner</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.520" end="00:04:51.040" style="s2">thoughts?</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.040" end="00:04:53.680" style="s2">Miss Lou, thank you for taking care of</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.040" end="00:04:58.720" style="s2">Juna for me. This is the chicken soup I</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.680" end="00:05:00.560" style="s2">made for Junior Wayi. Try some.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.720" end="00:05:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pretended not to catch the bull, so</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.560" end="00:05:05.280" style="s2">she deliberately burned me. Such a cheap</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.520" end="00:05:06.320" style="s2">setup.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.280" end="00:05:08.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.320" end="00:05:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shing Yen would never be that vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.560" end="00:05:13.320" style="s2">She must be trying to frame Ching Yen.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.240" end="00:05:20.240" style="s2">She actually predicted it, right? How is</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.080" end="00:05:22.560" style="s2">that possible? Junway, don&#39;t blame Miss</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.240" end="00:05:26.560" style="s2">Lou. Miss Lou didn&#39;t mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.560" end="00:05:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, I didn&#39;t mean it. You did.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.560" end="00:05:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Lou is saying I deliberately burned</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.400" end="00:05:32.000" style="s2">myself and then framed you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.639" end="00:05:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.000" end="00:05:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know Miss Lou because of the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.240" end="00:05:40.160" style="s2">with Juni. You hold a grudge against me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.360" end="00:05:42.160" style="s2">But Juni and I truly love each other.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.160" end="00:05:44.880" style="s2">Besides, Junway already compensated you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.160" end="00:05:46.720" style="s2">Gave you 10 million. enough to keep you</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.880" end="00:05:48.479" style="s2">fed and comfortable for the rest of your</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.720" end="00:05:51.680" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.479" end="00:05:54.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chin, don&#39;t talk nonsense. I&#39;m grateful</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.680" end="00:05:56.320" style="s2">to Chin Yen for saving my life, but</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.320" end="00:05:58.240" style="s2">after marrying Luli, I&#39;ve kept my</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.320" end="00:05:59.199" style="s2">distance from her. There&#39;s no love</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.240" end="00:06:00.960" style="s2">between us.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.199" end="00:06:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is 10 million a lot?</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.960" end="00:06:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough to keep you fed for a lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.360" end="00:06:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 million? That much money? Talk about</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.240" end="00:06:12.000" style="s2">perfect timing. I was worried about</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.000" end="00:06:14.720" style="s2">ascending to the higher realm with not a</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.000" end="00:06:16.240" style="s2">penny to my name.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.720" end="00:06:18.160" style="s2">Give me 10 million and I&#39;ll do that</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.240" end="00:06:21.039" style="s2">thing with you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.160" end="00:06:22.960" style="s2">What thing? Divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.039" end="00:06:25.919" style="s2">As long as you give me money. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.960" end="00:06:28.800" style="s2">even know what divorce is. Whatever. As</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.919" end="00:06:33.160" style="s2">long as I get the money. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.800" end="00:06:33.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already tore up the 10 million.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.479" end="00:06:40.520" style="s2">That massive fortune just slipped right</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.120" end="00:06:40.520" style="s2">through my fingers.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.199" end="00:06:47.199" style="s2">So, um, how about you give me another 10</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.440" end="00:06:49.440" style="s2">million?</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.199" end="00:06:50.720" style="s2">I swear I&#39;ll divorce you. No delays. I</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.440" end="00:06:52.880" style="s2">promise.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.720" end="00:06:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Juja, take Ching out first. Deal with</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.880" end="00:06:58.360" style="s2">that burn.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.600" end="00:06:58.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, bro. Ching Yin, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.680" end="00:07:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, I always thought Ching</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.680" end="00:07:07.199" style="s2">Yen was sweet and innocent. But now, it</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.400" end="00:07:10.599" style="s2">seems the her I saw before might not</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.199" end="00:07:10.599" style="s2">have been real.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.280" end="00:07:16.720" style="s2">Change your clothes and come home. No</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.599" end="00:07:18.800" style="s2">divorce yet.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.720" end="00:07:21.120" style="s2">And I can both hear her thoughts. I need</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.800" end="00:07:23.919" style="s2">to figure out what&#39;s going on and</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.120" end="00:07:26.560" style="s2">whether the things she said are true. If</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.919" end="00:07:28.479" style="s2">they are I have to find a way to change</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.560" end="00:07:30.720" style="s2">my fate.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.479" end="00:07:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No divorce? Then I won&#39;t get my 10</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.720" end="00:07:35.520" style="s2">million. You&#39;re really not divorcing?</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.440" end="00:07:38.639" style="s2">Won&#39;t you at least reconsider? I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.520" end="00:07:41.360" style="s2">you 20% off. 30%. That&#39;s my final offer.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.639" end="00:07:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Change your clothes. We&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.360" end="00:07:46.919" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.000" end="00:07:46.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stingy cheapkate. Not a scent to spare.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.319" end="00:07:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of crap outfit is this?</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.080" end="00:07:56.879" style="s2">Seriously, can a person really change</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.960" end="00:07:59.680" style="s2">that much? Didn&#39;t she used to love</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.879" end="00:08:02.680" style="s2">wearing high heels?</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.680" end="00:08:02.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.039" end="00:08:09.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.440" end="00:08:12.599" style="s2">Wa! Your higher realm artifacts are</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.199" end="00:08:12.599" style="s2">truly extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.840" end="00:08:22.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Get in the car now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.360" end="00:08:28.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m ready. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.639" end="00:08:31.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to get in the car, not on top</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.639" end="00:08:33.919" style="s2">of the car.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.280" end="00:08:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, bro. Relax. I won&#39;t break your</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.919" end="00:08:37.680" style="s2">artifact.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.760" end="00:08:40.680" style="s2">Get down. I don&#39;t want to get pulled</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.680" end="00:08:40.680" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.920" end="00:08:50.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is a traffic cop?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.680" end="00:08:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad judgment and not even a clever one.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.320" end="00:08:58.600" style="s2">Clearly your IQ&#39;s dropped, too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.480" end="00:08:58.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so that&#39;s how it is.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.640" end="00:09:20.640" style="s2">Luly,</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.720" end="00:09:23.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sorry. I didn&#39;t know your talisman was</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.640" end="00:09:23.800" style="s2">so flimsy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.920" end="00:09:32.600" style="s2">President, the car you asked for.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.279" end="00:09:37.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal with this car yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.680" end="00:10:05.360" style="s2">Are you blind?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.519" end="00:10:08.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to buckle your seat belt.</p>
