<p begin="00:19:29.520" end="00:19:33.200" style="s2">isn&#39;t even the first time.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.880" end="00:19:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honjo,</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.200" end="00:19:36.720" style="s2">shut up. Bro, why won&#39;t you let me</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.799" end="00:19:38.240" style="s2">speak? She did something to you. Ruined</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.720" end="00:19:40.080" style="s2">you and made you marry her. The whole</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.240" end="00:19:42.720" style="s2">capital knows about it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.080" end="00:19:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she hadn&#39;t swooped in and meddled,</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.720" end="00:19:46.480" style="s2">you&#39;d have married Jing long ago. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.120" end="00:19:47.039" style="s2">because Dunway and I were never meant to</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.480" end="00:19:49.039" style="s2">be.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.039" end="00:19:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ching, you&#39;re beautiful and gracious.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.039" end="00:19:52.240" style="s2">You and my brother are a match made in</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.200" end="00:19:53.919" style="s2">heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.240" end="00:19:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.919" end="00:19:58.720" style="s2">Only Ching Yen is worthy of my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.880" end="00:20:01.679" style="s2">I suggest you get a clue and get the</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.720" end="00:20:04.559" style="s2">hell out of our Shin family. I&#39;m willing</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.679" end="00:20:06.320" style="s2">to divorce. He&#39;s the one who won&#39;t. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.559" end="00:20:07.760" style="s2">wonder if your family&#39;s gone bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.320" end="00:20:11.120" style="s2">Can&#39;t even cough up the 10 million</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.760" end="00:20:12.640" style="s2">divorce settlement. June away. Is it</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.120" end="00:20:15.640" style="s2">true you&#39;re the one refusing the</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.640" end="00:20:15.640" style="s2">divorce?</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.240" end="00:20:19.120" style="s2">Arian family creed says, &quot;A virtuous</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.000" end="00:20:21.679" style="s2">wife brings fortune for three</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.120" end="00:20:26.440" style="s2">generations. A vicious, scheming woman</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.679" end="00:20:26.440" style="s2">like her has no place in Arian family.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.640" end="00:20:32.240" style="s2">Go on, curse me out. Yell while you</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.960" end="00:20:34.159" style="s2">still can get a few more in. In a year,</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.240" end="00:20:36.400" style="s2">your son falls downstairs. Your daughter</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.159" end="00:20:39.039" style="s2">drowns. Your youngest son loses eyes and</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.400" end="00:20:41.039" style="s2">kidneys. Your husband loses oxygen.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.039" end="00:20:44.440" style="s2">You&#39;ll have late stage cancer. Won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.039" end="00:20:44.440" style="s2">curse then.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.919" end="00:20:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, you</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.440" end="00:20:52.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; wait. Am I hearing Luli&#39;s thoughts right</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.360" end="00:20:53.679" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.159" end="00:20:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let any of this happen. First</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.679" end="00:20:56.720" style="s2">thing I&#39;ll do is take my mom to the</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.440" end="00:20:58.880" style="s2">hospital for a checkup.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.720" end="00:21:00.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, what nonsense are you spouting?</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.880" end="00:21:04.880" style="s2">How can my heart and kidneys be dug out?</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.960" end="00:21:07.280" style="s2">Mom&#39;s healthy. How could she get sick?</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.880" end="00:21:10.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey there, brother. I see your face is</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.280" end="00:21:10.840" style="s2">looking a little green.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.360" end="00:21:13.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be?</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.039" end="00:21:18.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.919" end="00:21:19.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is your love life cursed or what?</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.159" end="00:21:20.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? What is she supposed to mean by</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.760" end="00:21:22.400" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.559" end="00:21:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This little cutie still asking what she</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.400" end="00:21:26.799" style="s2">means? She means you&#39;re being cheated</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.080" end="00:21:28.240" style="s2">on. Get it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.799" end="00:21:30.400" style="s2">This guy must have skipped leveling up</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.240" end="00:21:32.480" style="s2">his IQ when he was reincarnated. No</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.400" end="00:21:33.280" style="s2">wonder he got cheated on. Brains clearly</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.480" end="00:21:35.360" style="s2">don&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.280" end="00:21:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honjo&#39;s girlfriend really did put horns</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.360" end="00:21:37.360" style="s2">on him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.760" end="00:21:38.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wicked woman. You&#39;re saying I got a</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.360" end="00:21:40.960" style="s2">green cloud on my head?</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.559" end="00:21:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear I&#39;ll beat you to death.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.960" end="00:21:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down. Calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.520" end="00:21:48.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, I know you don&#39;t like Hanjo. But</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.400" end="00:21:49.840" style="s2">you can&#39;t viciously curse his girlfriend</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.320" end="00:21:52.400" style="s2">for cheating.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.840" end="00:21:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s cursing him? Poor guy doesn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.400" end="00:21:58.240" style="s2">know. His little girlfriend just got out</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.200" end="00:22:00.960" style="s2">of another man&#39;s bed. Congrats. Your</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.240" end="00:22:07.080" style="s2">girl&#39;s getting another boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.960" end="00:22:07.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, I&#39;m going to kill you. Kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.000" end="00:22:12.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your little girlfriend, she&#39;s back from</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.840" end="00:22:12.840" style="s2">Thailand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.120" end="00:22:16.880" style="s2">Oh, wow. What a bold heart. Coming back</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.039" end="00:22:18.320" style="s2">from Thailand, bringing her straight</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.880" end="00:22:21.200" style="s2">home without even checking what she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.320" end="00:22:22.720" style="s2">been up to.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.200" end="00:22:25.440" style="s2">That technique is pretty impressive,</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.720" end="00:22:27.840" style="s2">though. What&#39;s it called again? Let me</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.440" end="00:22:30.840" style="s2">see. Oh, it&#39;s called gender reassignment</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.840" end="00:22:30.840" style="s2">surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.640" end="00:22:43.320" style="s2">Why are you kneeling down? Junway Jeda,</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.080" end="00:22:43.320" style="s2">come here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.840" end="00:22:47.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s actually going on with her?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.520" end="00:22:49.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her brain is fried.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.280" end="00:22:51.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why can I hear her inner thoughts? Can</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.840" end="00:22:52.159" style="s2">you guys hear them?</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.440" end="00:22:57.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.159" end="00:22:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, everything she said is true. Pretty</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.280" end="00:23:03.120" style="s2">much</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.840" end="00:23:05.919" style="s2">then you&#39;re GE. Air G told me his</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.120" end="00:23:08.919" style="s2">girlfriend. Yeah, she did come from</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.919" end="00:23:08.919" style="s2">Thailand.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.520" end="00:23:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. How could that be? How could</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.960" end="00:23:19.600" style="s2">she be that sweet little thing?</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.840" end="00:23:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, you&#39;ve gone too far. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.600" end="00:23:23.919" style="s2">just spread rumors like that. Hanjo&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.600" end="00:23:27.760" style="s2">girlfriend. Can you take that close pin</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.919" end="00:23:32.120" style="s2">out of your mouth before you speak?</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.760" end="00:23:32.120" style="s2">I&#39;m not laughing at you on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.640" end="00:23:38.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way. I&#39;m just trying to be fair</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.400" end="00:23:41.120" style="s2">here. Why is Miss Luke humiliating her</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.799" end="00:23:43.360" style="s2">like this? You call a kind reminder</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.120" end="00:23:45.200" style="s2">humiliation.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.360" end="00:23:48.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, you really did go too far this</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.200" end="00:23:51.440" style="s2">time. Apologize to Gin Yen right now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.159" end="00:23:53.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, don&#39;t say that. Chin Yen has</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.440" end="00:23:55.200" style="s2">always talk like this.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.679" end="00:23:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you still want to speak up for</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.200" end="00:24:00.159" style="s2">others? With that time, you should worry</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.000" end="00:24:01.679" style="s2">about yourself instead. You treat her</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.159" end="00:24:03.600" style="s2">like the moonlight, but she treats you</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.679" end="00:24:05.280" style="s2">like an ATM.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.600" end="00:24:08.080" style="s2">Just waiting to snatch your company and</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.280" end="00:24:10.799" style="s2">send you to the afterlife.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.080" end="00:24:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gen saved my life. She&#39;s always been</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.799" end="00:24:15.679" style="s2">kind. Would she really betray me?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.000" end="00:24:18.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jin loves our big brother so much. How</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.679" end="00:24:19.360" style="s2">could she possibly betray him? Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.080" end="00:24:22.080" style="s2">Ginian has always wanted to marry</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.360" end="00:24:24.720" style="s2">Junway. She would never betray Junway.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.080" end="00:24:26.000" style="s2">Miss Louu, I know that because of the</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.720" end="00:24:29.120" style="s2">divorce between you and Junway, you</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.000" end="00:24:33.080" style="s2">blame me. It&#39;s all my fault. I&#39;m the one</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.120" end="00:24:33.080" style="s2">who made Miss Lou angry.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.000" end="00:24:42.240" style="s2">I&#39;d like to apologize to Miss Lou with</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.679" end="00:24:45.559" style="s2">tea instead of wine. Can you forgive me,</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.240" end="00:24:45.559" style="s2">Miss Lou?</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.880" end="00:25:01.919" style="s2">Miss Lou won&#39;t drink it. Does that mean</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.720" end="00:25:03.600" style="s2">you won&#39;t accept my apology? Miss Goo, I</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.919" end="00:25:05.279" style="s2">forgot to tell you earlier. Your</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.600" end="00:25:07.440" style="s2">forehead is sunken and your brow has a</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.279" end="00:25:09.919" style="s2">pinkish glow. It looks like you have a</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.440" end="00:25:13.120" style="s2">romance calamity. If you back off now,</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.919" end="00:25:15.279" style="s2">you might still escape it. Junway, Miss</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.120" end="00:25:16.320" style="s2">Lou won&#39;t accept my apology. What do I</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.279" end="00:25:17.840" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.320" end="00:25:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly,</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.840" end="00:25:24.640" style="s2">she means well. Just drink it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.000" end="00:25:27.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Exactly. Ching Yen is so</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.640" end="00:25:28.480" style="s2">magnanimous.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.279" end="00:25:30.960" style="s2">No wonder your whole family died</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.480" end="00:25:34.440" style="s2">tragically. With that IQ, you&#39;d get lost</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.960" end="00:25:34.440" style="s2">even in the underworld.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.559" end="00:25:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This tea with something extra in it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.320" end="00:25:44.559" style="s2">Maybe you should drink it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.200" end="00:25:47.880" style="s2">There&#39;s really something in that tea.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.559" end="00:25:47.880" style="s2">That brutal.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.120" end="00:25:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Lou, I&#39;m just offering you a cup of</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.960" end="00:25:56.640" style="s2">tea. What exactly are you implying?</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.120" end="00:25:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just tea. You can drink it</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.640" end="00:26:02.799" style="s2">yourself, too. What an idiot. Only two</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.840" end="00:26:04.640" style="s2">men here, yet you pull the stunt.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.799" end="00:26:07.600" style="s2">Who are you trying to gross out? Junu,</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.640" end="00:26:11.000" style="s2">Miss Lou still won&#39;t forgive me. What</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.600" end="00:26:11.000" style="s2">should I do?</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.200" end="00:26:16.120" style="s2">Well, there&#39;s nothing I can do either.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.600" end="00:26:22.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe go beg your sister-in-law again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.360" end="00:26:26.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Matters between you youngsters as an</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.440" end="00:26:28.320" style="s2">elder.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.960" end="00:26:30.480" style="s2">I won&#39;t get involved.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.320" end="00:26:33.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible? How could it be</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.480" end="00:26:33.880" style="s2">the little cutie?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.159" end="00:26:39.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.440" end="00:26:39.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why stay? The te&#39;s drugged.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.240" end="00:26:43.960" style="s2">We&#39;ll kick in soon.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.520" end="00:26:51.520" style="s2">Since today is a family dinner, I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.360" end="00:26:54.840" style="s2">intrude. Junway, Jeda, auntie, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.520" end="00:26:54.840" style="s2">going now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.679" end="00:27:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s really something in that tea,</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.200" end="00:27:06.799" style="s2">isn&#39;t there?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.400" end="00:27:08.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s been right twice already. Then</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.799" end="00:27:12.039" style="s2">Ching Yen rushing out like that. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.799" end="00:27:12.039" style="s2">tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.640" end="00:27:17.200" style="s2">Of course she&#39;s going.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.760" end="00:27:19.120" style="s2">Of course she&#39;s going to find a man to</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.200" end="00:27:21.200" style="s2">get the antidote. Soon your brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.120" end="00:27:25.960" style="s2">head is going to be the same color as</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.200" end="00:27:25.960" style="s2">your second brother&#39;s. A green prairie.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.080" end="00:27:30.840" style="s2">Love is a light. Green enough to make</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.679" end="00:27:30.840" style="s2">you glow.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.440" end="00:27:40.720" style="s2">Hey, I&#39;m out of the Shin house now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.320" end="00:27:43.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Shing Group&#39;s bid proposal is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.720" end="00:27:45.919" style="s2">While Shinjun is away, go to his office</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.039" end="00:27:47.679" style="s2">and steal the proposal. Don&#39;t worry,</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.919" end="00:27:50.919" style="s2">I&#39;ve already arranged backup for you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.679" end="00:27:50.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.799" end="00:28:13.320" style="s2">Ali is here. Come here. Come to grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.039" end="00:28:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forehead full golden light.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.799" end="00:28:20.000" style="s2">This is clearly the face of great wealth</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.559" end="00:28:23.360" style="s2">and noble birth. Ah, but dragged down by</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.000" end="00:28:25.919" style="s2">this family of walking disasters.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.360" end="00:28:28.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here? Since everyone&#39;s here,</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.919" end="00:28:31.039" style="s2">I&#39;ll make myself clear right now. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.240" end="00:28:33.600" style="s2">and Juna are already getting divorced.</p>
