<p begin="00:28:35.279" end="00:28:39.279" style="s2">all today. Dad, I&#39;m not divorcing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.279" end="00:28:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. Things that have been given away</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.279" end="00:28:44.880" style="s2">don&#39;t get taken back. Steal from me.</p>
