<p begin="00:28:44.880" end="00:28:50.159" style="s2">You&#39;re just spinning in circles being</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.399" end="00:28:54.520" style="s2">shameless. Sis-in-law, that&#39;s our dad.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.159" end="00:28:54.520" style="s2">Let&#39;s be a little polite, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.200" end="00:28:59.360" style="s2">Lashian, I&#39;m thinking this marriage</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.039" end="00:29:00.960" style="s2">doesn&#39;t have to end after all.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.360" end="00:29:03.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, move your abacus a little</p>
