<p begin="00:38:12.720" end="00:38:17.760" style="s2">first. Let him reflect on his sins.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.400" end="00:38:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, I was tricked too. Ma&#39;am, he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.760" end="00:38:21.520" style="s2">not my illegitimate son.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.440" end="00:38:40.520" style="s2">Bro,</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.480" end="00:38:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junway big brother.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.560" end="00:38:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, from now on, we should probably be</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.880" end="00:38:56.720" style="s2">nicer to our sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.960" end="00:38:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise, I&#39;m seriously afraid that</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.720" end="00:38:59.760" style="s2">with just one finger. She could crush us</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.800" end="00:39:01.599" style="s2">to death.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.760" end="00:39:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll give the orders as</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.599" end="00:39:07.640" style="s2">soon as I get back. From now on, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.000" end="00:39:07.640" style="s2">treat her like royalty.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.320" end="00:39:16.520" style="s2">Uh, it was a moment of panic. Forgive</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.720" end="00:39:16.520" style="s2">me. Forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.359" end="00:39:20.880" style="s2">If that&#39;s how you act in a panic, then</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.880" end="00:39:23.680" style="s2">when you&#39;re not panicking, how savage</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.880" end="00:39:26.680" style="s2">must you be? We understand. We</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.680" end="00:39:26.680" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.240" end="00:39:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t we going to catch someone? Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.320" end="00:39:35.599" style="s2">go. Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.440" end="00:39:37.040" style="s2">CEO. CEO. There&#39;s an</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.599" end="00:39:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say one more word and next time I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.040" end="00:39:42.800" style="s2">twist your skull off. CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.640" end="00:39:44.560" style="s2">CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.800" end="00:39:46.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t smash through a brick wall, so</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.560" end="00:39:47.119" style="s2">you&#39;re going for big sister&#39;s chest</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.000" end="00:39:50.079" style="s2">instead.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.119" end="00:39:55.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we hurry up?</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.079" end="00:39:55.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CEO. CEO. There&#39;s a meeting. CO</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.160" end="00:39:59.160" style="s2">sister-in-law,</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.680" end="00:40:03.400" style="s2">let me handle this,</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.772" end="00:40:12.880" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.880" end="00:40:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Goo. What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.880" end="00:40:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So hot.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.560" end="00:40:35.760" style="s2">Wa! How thrilling. If we&#39;d come in a bit</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.040" end="00:40:36.960" style="s2">later,</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.760" end="00:40:39.520" style="s2">the two of them would have been</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.960" end="00:40:42.480" style="s2">completely naked.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.520" end="00:40:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, everything Luly said was true. Jing,</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.480" end="00:40:46.000" style="s2">you actually stole my brother&#39;s bid</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.760" end="00:40:47.440" style="s2">documents and behind my brother&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.000" end="00:40:50.839" style="s2">You&#39;re in the office doing this with</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.440" end="00:40:50.839" style="s2">another man.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.800" end="00:40:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily&#39;s inner thoughts were confirmed and</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.280" end="00:40:58.400" style="s2">what she said about me being pushed off</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.400" end="00:41:00.960" style="s2">a cliff drowning having his eyes and</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.400" end="00:41:02.319" style="s2">kidney dug out being killed by son</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.960" end="00:41:04.560" style="s2">cancer. Does that mean all of it is</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.319" end="00:41:07.440" style="s2">true?</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.560" end="00:41:08.079" style="s2">No. I absolutely cannot let these things</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.440" end="00:41:12.000" style="s2">happen.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.079" end="00:41:13.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie auntie, I didn&#39;t do it. Junway.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.000" end="00:41:15.760" style="s2">Junway. It&#39;s not what you think. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.920" end="00:41:17.040" style="s2">him. He forced me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.760" end="00:41:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, you&#39;re the one who threw</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.040" end="00:41:21.599" style="s2">yourself at me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.240" end="00:41:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying. Junway, believe me, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.599" end="00:41:27.040" style="s2">the one I love most. Shinjuna better not</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.400" end="00:41:29.200" style="s2">be going soft.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.040" end="00:41:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did Shen Yen turn into this? The</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.200" end="00:41:32.800" style="s2">frame up. She wanted to frame Luli and</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.520" end="00:41:35.119" style="s2">ended up reaping what she sowed.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.800" end="00:41:37.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She loves you. Otherwise, why would she</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.119" end="00:41:39.280" style="s2">only cheat on you and not on anyone</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.599" end="00:41:42.000" style="s2">else? Isn&#39;t that love enough?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.280" end="00:41:45.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.000" end="00:41:48.000" style="s2">Guing Yen, you said he forced you. Then</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.200" end="00:41:49.520" style="s2">what about the bid document?</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.000" end="00:41:51.359" style="s2">Who told you to steal the bid?</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.520" end="00:41:52.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. I really don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.359" end="00:41:53.760" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.160" end="00:41:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew damn well how important that</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.760" end="00:41:57.040" style="s2">bid was to me. To Shin Group. Why did</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.920" end="00:41:59.040" style="s2">you betray me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.040" end="00:42:00.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way. I was forced into it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.040" end="00:42:01.599" style="s2">If I didn&#39;t do it, he would have</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.400" end="00:42:03.200" style="s2">destroyed me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.599" end="00:42:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;d still believe a word you</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.200" end="00:42:09.599" style="s2">say? Talk. Who&#39;s behind all this?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.440" end="00:42:10.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way. You have to believe me. He</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.599" end="00:42:13.040" style="s2">just told me to come to the office and</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.720" end="00:42:16.040" style="s2">grab a bit. I swear I don&#39;t know who he</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.040" end="00:42:16.040" style="s2">is.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.040" end="00:42:27.000" style="s2">She really isn&#39;t the mastermind.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.200" end="00:42:33.960" style="s2">The mastermind&#39;s face can&#39;t even be</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.960" end="00:42:33.960" style="s2">seen.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.800" end="00:42:38.720" style="s2">Even though we can&#39;t see the face, the</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.480" end="00:42:39.599" style="s2">mastermind has been watching from the</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.720" end="00:42:41.680" style="s2">shadows all along.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.599" end="00:42:45.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in the light. The killer&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.680" end="00:42:47.839" style="s2">dark. If we want to lure him out, looks</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.119" end="00:42:49.200" style="s2">like we can&#39;t touch Guing for now. Out</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.839" end="00:42:52.960" style="s2">of respect for the time you saved my</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.200" end="00:42:54.640" style="s2">life, I&#39;ll let today&#39;s slide. Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.960" end="00:42:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dunway, you forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.640" end="00:42:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said get out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.720" end="00:43:08.720" style="s2">President, I&#39;ll be leaving too then.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.560" end="00:43:10.480" style="s2">Mr. Shen, I swear it really wasn&#39;t me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.720" end="00:43:11.599" style="s2">She forced me into it. Please just let</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.480" end="00:43:13.119" style="s2">me off. President,</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.599" end="00:43:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; take her away.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.119" end="00:43:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really wasn&#39;t me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.920" end="00:43:25.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, why&#39;d you let her off so easily?</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.359" end="00:43:25.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because of love, obviously.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.319" end="00:43:28.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to use her to find the</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.520" end="00:43:31.680" style="s2">real killer behind all this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.800" end="00:43:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.480" end="00:43:39.119" style="s2">Boss, so were you satisfied with my</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.119" end="00:43:42.760" style="s2">service just now? If you were, then</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.119" end="00:43:42.760" style="s2">upgrade my package.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.599" end="00:43:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis-in-law was absolutely killing it the</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.760" end="00:43:49.000" style="s2">whole way,</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.119" end="00:43:53.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guess. So, what package?</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.359" end="00:43:59.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The divorce upgrade package.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.160" end="00:44:00.160" style="s2">All you have to do is agree to divorce</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.119" end="00:44:01.280" style="s2">me and give me 10 million and I&#39;ll help</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.160" end="00:44:02.640" style="s2">you dig out every single trader in the</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.280" end="00:44:06.400" style="s2">company. I&#39;ll catch them all and help</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.640" end="00:44:10.119" style="s2">you find the mastermind. Where did you</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.400" end="00:44:10.119" style="s2">even get a divorce agreement?</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.125" end="00:44:19.040" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.599" end="00:44:21.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, printing this much planning to run</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.040" end="00:44:23.440" style="s2">Junway Lul&#39;s inner thoughts are all</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.119" end="00:44:25.040" style="s2">real. You have a treasure and still want</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.440" end="00:44:26.720" style="s2">divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.040" end="00:44:29.359" style="s2">You little brat. Do you think your</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.720" end="00:44:30.720" style="s2">mother&#39;s life is too long?</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.359" end="00:44:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time I was afraid she wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.720" end="00:44:34.000" style="s2">agree to the divorce, so I had my</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.240" end="00:44:38.119" style="s2">assistant print a few extra copies. Why</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.000" end="00:44:38.119" style="s2">haven&#39;t they been thrown out yet?</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.319" end="00:44:44.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget about the divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.839" end="00:44:54.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyway, I&#39;ll find myself. TSK.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.880" end="00:44:58.079" style="s2">The bidding incident proves fate can be</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.720" end="00:45:00.000" style="s2">changed.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.079" end="00:45:02.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case, until the Shun family</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.000" end="00:45:05.720" style="s2">crisis is resolved, I absolutely cannot</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.319" end="00:45:05.720" style="s2">let her leave.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.560" end="00:45:10.640" style="s2">There&#39;s an auction tomorrow night. Come</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.160" end="00:45:12.240" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.640" end="00:45:14.480" style="s2">Money first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.240" end="00:45:14.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.480" end="00:45:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.960" end="00:45:19.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, card or Alipay? You know about Alip</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.680" end="00:45:20.560" style="s2">Pay now?</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.119" end="00:45:21.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just not familiar with it, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.560" end="00:45:25.200" style="s2">all. I&#39;m not stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.680" end="00:45:31.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I taught her that. Impressive, right?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.200" end="00:45:31.000" style="s2">I taught him that. Impressive, right?</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.381" end="00:45:34.400" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.319" end="00:45:36.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you won&#39;t divorce me, huh? Then</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.400" end="00:45:36.960" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for screwing you over</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.319" end="00:45:38.800" style="s2">royally.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.960" end="00:45:39.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.800" end="00:45:41.920" style="s2">monthly package.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.839" end="00:45:43.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Thank you, boss. So, when can I</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.920" end="00:45:44.880" style="s2">sign the contract? Can I get a raise if</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.599" end="00:45:46.640" style="s2">I do well? Oh, right. Is there</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.880" end="00:45:48.400" style="s2">insurance? Any benefits? What if I get</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.640" end="00:45:50.720" style="s2">injured on the job? Oh, and I won&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.400" end="00:45:52.400" style="s2">anything unethical or illegal. Okay,</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.720" end="00:45:56.119" style="s2">thank you, boss. I can do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.400" end="00:45:56.119" style="s2">Contact me anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.271" end="00:45:58.960" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.839" end="00:46:00.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.960" end="00:46:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I booked you a health checkup. I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.240" end="00:46:05.839" style="s2">the driver take you over in a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.680" end="00:46:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Mom, go get checked about Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.839" end="00:46:11.400" style="s2">He still won&#39;t reveal where the</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.440" end="00:46:11.400" style="s2">illegitimate child is.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.400" end="00:46:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave this to me. I&#39;ll get to the bottom</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.400" end="00:46:17.560" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.440" end="00:46:24.920" style="s2">Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.599" end="00:46:28.599" style="s2">Junway,</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.920" end="00:46:35.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you just won&#39;t go away, will you? Junway</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.720" end="00:46:37.119" style="s2">Jeda, I just came to apologize for what</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.680" end="00:46:39.359" style="s2">happened before.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.119" end="00:46:41.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need for apologies, Miss Goo. I told</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.359" end="00:46:42.319" style="s2">you last time since you saved me, I</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.119" end="00:46:45.440" style="s2">won&#39;t hold the pit thing against you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.319" end="00:46:47.359" style="s2">We&#39;re even done.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.440" end="00:46:50.359" style="s2">Junior, are you really going to be this</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.359" end="00:46:50.359" style="s2">heartless?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.640" end="00:46:56.480" style="s2">Miss Lou, you&#39;re Junior&#39;s wife. He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.520" end="00:47:00.400" style="s2">definitely listen to you. Help me. Put</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.480" end="00:47:02.240" style="s2">in a good word with Junway, please. Me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.400" end="00:47:06.040" style="s2">Help you plead your case so you can push</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.240" end="00:47:06.040" style="s2">me into the water again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.560" end="00:47:30.480" style="s2">Stay by my side. Don&#39;t go anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.720" end="00:47:32.480" style="s2">Miss Goo, I&#39;ve said everything that</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.480" end="00:47:35.960" style="s2">needs to be said. I hope you won&#39;t do</p>
