<p begin="00:59:23.119" end="00:59:27.799" style="s2">that? Who the hell is she?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.880" end="00:59:44.599" style="s2">You saved me again.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.720" end="00:59:48.559" style="s2">How dare you? You dare hands on this</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.000" end="00:59:49.839" style="s2">grandmaster.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.559" end="00:59:53.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go. Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.839" end="00:59:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, sorry. Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.680" end="00:59:58.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly,</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.520" end="00:59:59.119" style="s2">I&#39;m a patient. Is this how you treat a</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.319" end="01:00:01.680" style="s2">patient?</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.119" end="01:00:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, it was just instinct. [music] I</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.680" end="01:00:06.640" style="s2">didn&#39;t do it on purpose. Besides, I</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.760" end="01:00:08.880" style="s2">barely used any force. Let me get</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.640" end="01:00:13.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.880" end="01:00:15.599" style="s2">Don&#39;t you touch me. Back up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.760" end="01:00:19.000" style="s2">More.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.599" end="01:00:19.000" style="s2">A little more.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.920" end="01:00:23.640" style="s2">Just stay right there,</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.839" end="01:00:26.839" style="s2">nurse.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.599" end="01:00:41.680" style="s2">So, what you were trying to do just now</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.119" end="01:00:45.079" style="s2">was</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.680" end="01:00:45.079" style="s2">fill me up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.920" end="01:00:50.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who wants to feel you up? I was just</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.839" end="01:00:53.640" style="s2">trying to wake you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.640" end="01:00:53.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh,</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.839" end="01:00:59.760" style="s2">sister-in-law, I found something. Bro,</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.040" end="01:01:02.720" style="s2">you&#39;re awake. What happened to your arm?</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.760" end="01:01:04.319" style="s2">Uh, it&#39;s nothing. Just dislocated. What</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.720" end="01:01:05.839" style="s2">did you find?</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.319" end="01:01:07.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The brake line on that car was cut and</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.839" end="01:01:09.359" style="s2">the fuel tank was slashed. Once an</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.839" end="01:01:10.880" style="s2">accident happens and the brakes fail, it</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.359" end="01:01:12.559" style="s2">would instantly trigger an explosion.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.880" end="01:01:14.880" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.559" end="01:01:17.200" style="s2">Bro, thank goodness in time. Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.880" end="01:01:21.720" style="s2">we&#39;d all be blown to bits. And she even</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.200" end="01:01:21.720" style="s2">coughed up blood trying to save you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.240" end="01:01:28.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.680" end="01:01:28.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m hurt. Why are you so nervous?</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.040" end="01:01:34.839" style="s2">Uh, you&#39;re this nervous? Could it be?</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.799" end="01:01:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t want to pay me back.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.720" end="01:01:47.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The compensation I owe you. I won&#39;t show</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.319" end="01:01:48.160" style="s2">you a single scent.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.119" end="01:01:49.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You have no idea how much</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.160" end="01:01:50.880" style="s2">spiritual energy I&#39;ve been saving you. I</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.599" end="01:01:52.960" style="s2">don&#39;t even know how many days I&#39;ll need</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.880" end="01:01:55.839" style="s2">to recover. So, I want you to compensate</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.960" end="01:01:58.559" style="s2">me. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.839" end="01:01:58.559" style="s2">Triple</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.680" end="01:02:02.680" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.000" end="01:02:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you going to do about Guingen?</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.640" end="01:02:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, sweetie. Guingen screwed you over</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.599" end="01:02:12.480" style="s2">this badly. Don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.040" end="01:02:13.760" style="s2">going to let her off. Does she have some</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.480" end="01:02:14.319" style="s2">dirt on you? Something she&#39;s holding</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.760" end="01:02:16.400" style="s2">over your head?</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.319" end="01:02:18.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guing once saved my life. But that life</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.400" end="01:02:20.960" style="s2">debt has already been repaid. This time,</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.319" end="01:02:22.960" style="s2">I&#39;ll get to the bottom of everything and</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.960" end="01:02:25.040" style="s2">hand Guing Yen over to the police.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.960" end="01:02:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you out of your mind? Guuching is</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.040" end="01:02:30.680" style="s2">not the type to save someone out of the</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.040" end="01:02:30.680" style="s2">goodness of her heart.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.040" end="01:02:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.280" end="01:02:42.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way. Junior way. Thank God you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.440" end="01:02:45.359" style="s2">okay.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.960" end="01:02:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was worried sick.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.359" end="01:02:48.799" style="s2">Fake concern.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.799" end="01:02:51.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, sweetie. Who are you crying</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.799" end="01:02:53.440" style="s2">for? You&#39;re just worried. Shinjun hasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.359" end="01:02:56.160" style="s2">died yet, aren&#39;t you? How could Miss Lou</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.440" end="01:02:58.400" style="s2">think that of me? I just feel that</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.160" end="01:03:03.040" style="s2">before Junway got married, nothing this</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.400" end="01:03:04.960" style="s2">dangerous ever happened. So why now?</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.040" end="01:03:08.480" style="s2">I&#39;m not saying Miss Lou is a husband</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.960" end="01:03:10.799" style="s2">killer. Husband killer. I don&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.480" end="01:03:12.559" style="s2">kill husbands. I&#39;ll kill cute little</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.799" end="01:03:13.440" style="s2">things like you, too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.559" end="01:03:16.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shut up, too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.440" end="01:03:16.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure thing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.880" end="01:03:29.680" style="s2">H cute little thing. You treat someone</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.200" end="01:03:32.480" style="s2">like your savior and they treat you like</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.680" end="01:03:34.319" style="s2">a cute little pet. Everything, all of it</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.480" end="01:03:35.760" style="s2">was orchestrated by that woman right in</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.319" end="01:03:38.079" style="s2">front of you when you were being</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.760" end="01:03:40.079" style="s2">ambushed. That woman was watching from</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.079" end="01:03:42.000" style="s2">around the corner.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.079" end="01:03:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this whole thing from start to finish</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.000" end="01:03:46.640" style="s2">was a setup. So Gucci Yen started</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.240" end="01:03:48.160" style="s2">scheming against me this early on. How</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.640" end="01:03:50.480" style="s2">dare she?</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.160" end="01:03:51.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What grudge do we even have against her?</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.480" end="01:03:53.280" style="s2">She went through all that trouble to set</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.920" end="01:03:55.680" style="s2">up my brother.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.280" end="01:03:58.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junway, don&#39;t misunderstand me. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.680" end="01:04:00.960" style="s2">blaming Miss Lou. I just heard that Miss</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.319" end="01:04:03.440" style="s2">Lou is frail and delicate. Never learned</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.960" end="01:04:05.280" style="s2">martial arts and definitely can&#39;t fly.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.440" end="01:04:09.200" style="s2">So, how does Miss Lou explain any of</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.280" end="01:04:10.240" style="s2">this? What&#39;s it to you?</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.200" end="01:04:11.920" style="s2">I&#39;m just worried someone with bad</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.240" end="01:04:15.039" style="s2">intentions is deliberately getting close</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.920" end="01:04:16.799" style="s2">to June. I&#39;m afraid he&#39;s in danger. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.039" end="01:04:18.640" style="s2">seen shameless people, but never anyone</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.799" end="01:04:20.480" style="s2">as shameless as you. The thief crying,</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.640" end="01:04:22.559" style="s2">&quot;Catch the thief. You really are</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.480" end="01:04:25.119" style="s2">something.&quot; You,</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.559" end="01:04:27.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guing Yin, that night in the lady&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.119" end="01:04:29.920" style="s2">lounge, who exactly was that man with</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.440" end="01:04:33.200" style="s2">you,</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.920" end="01:04:35.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Juni? What are you talking about? I was</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.200" end="01:04:36.559" style="s2">the only one in the lounge.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.679" end="01:04:41.960" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.559" end="01:04:41.960" style="s2">You You must have seen it wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.319" end="01:04:46.319" style="s2">Junway, after all these years together,</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.960" end="01:04:51.400" style="s2">are you really going to doubt me over</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.319" end="01:04:51.400" style="s2">one word from her? You&#39;re going too far.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.720" end="01:04:57.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mastermind behind this has plotted</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.079" end="01:05:01.200" style="s2">so many times and still couldn&#39;t take me</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.920" end="01:05:02.000" style="s2">down. They won&#39;t just let it go.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.200" end="01:05:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have [clears throat] my assistant keep</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.000" end="01:05:06.760" style="s2">an eye on her.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.880" end="01:05:06.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, big brother.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.440" end="01:05:22.480" style="s2">Shinjjun Way is already starting to</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.640" end="01:05:24.319" style="s2">suspect me. That woman Luli is even more</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.480" end="01:05:26.480" style="s2">of a cunning little thing. We can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.319" end="01:05:27.760" style="s2">sit here waiting to be destroyed. You</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.480" end="01:05:30.000" style="s2">need to figure out a way right now to</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.760" end="01:05:33.799" style="s2">get that little sweetheart to sign the</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.000" end="01:05:33.799" style="s2">share transfer agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.285" end="01:05:37.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.440" end="01:05:45.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk. Where&#39;s the girl?</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.839" end="01:05:46.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk or I&#39;ll whip you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.520" end="01:05:47.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.480" end="01:05:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.119" end="01:05:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ouch, that hurts.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.640" end="01:05:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoa. So, the little sweetheart secret</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.480" end="01:05:54.079" style="s2">love child has been exposed. Madam Han</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.720" end="01:05:56.319" style="s2">really knows how to wield that whip</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.079" end="01:05:58.559" style="s2">beautifully.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.319" end="01:05:59.920" style="s2">Big brother, don&#39;t tell me mom has lost</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.559" end="01:06:03.119" style="s2">her mind.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.920" end="01:06:06.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong,</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.119" end="01:06:09.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; baby. Oh, you&#39;re finally back.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.079" end="01:06:11.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what the</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.039" end="01:06:12.880" style="s2">h?</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.039" end="01:06:15.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s daughter-in-law. Mom hurt you and</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.880" end="01:06:17.280" style="s2">Junior got hurt. Oh, you really scared</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.359" end="01:06:20.240" style="s2">me to death. Uh,</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.280" end="01:06:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m your son. I&#39;m the one who got</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.240" end="01:06:23.960" style="s2">hurt. Me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.960" end="01:06:32.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s some pocket money from me. Go on,</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.599" end="01:06:32.200" style="s2">take it. Thanks, Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.319" end="01:06:35.520" style="s2">Good kid.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.760" end="01:06:38.240" style="s2">Can you just think about your dad for a</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.520" end="01:06:42.200" style="s2">second? About his bastard child?</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.240" end="01:06:42.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this isn&#39;t going to work.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.960" end="01:06:48.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, Madame Han really is such a kind</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.799" end="01:06:50.880" style="s2">soul. Too bad this poor fool is so dumb.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.079" end="01:06:52.960" style="s2">Not only did he get set up?</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.880" end="01:06:55.599" style="s2">He&#39;s raising someone else&#39;s kid. Some</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.960" end="01:06:57.039" style="s2">random liar told him the child was his</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.599" end="01:06:59.680" style="s2">and he didn&#39;t even bother with a</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.039" end="01:07:01.359" style="s2">paternity test. Just believed it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.680" end="01:07:04.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.359" end="01:07:04.480" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.559" end="01:07:09.200" style="s2">That&#39;s not all. The old man dug up some</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.799" end="01:07:10.799" style="s2">leads. He went to confront the bastard</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.200" end="01:07:12.720" style="s2">and the bastard just to force him into</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.799" end="01:07:14.559" style="s2">signing. The share transfer agreement</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.720" end="01:07:16.000" style="s2">shoved the old man to the ground. The</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.559" end="01:07:17.839" style="s2">old man hit his head and went into a</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.000" end="01:07:19.680" style="s2">coma. The bastard, scared of being</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.839" end="01:07:20.799" style="s2">exposed, just pulled out the old man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.680" end="01:07:23.799" style="s2">oxygen tube.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.799" end="01:07:23.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.000" end="01:07:27.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This little piece of trash. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.839" end="01:07:30.240" style="s2">beat him to death today.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.359" end="01:07:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it&#39;s fake. Everything she said is</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.240" end="01:07:35.000" style="s2">fake. Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.680" end="01:07:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re still running.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.039" end="01:07:36.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.680" end="01:07:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fake.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.720" end="01:07:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are they fighting again?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.920" end="01:08:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? All right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.480" end="01:08:09.000" style="s2">My bed&#39;s wet. I want to crash in your</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.440" end="01:08:09.000" style="s2">room for the night.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.600" end="01:08:21.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane? There are so many rooms</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.520" end="01:08:22.480" style="s2">and you just had to sleep in mine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.040" end="01:08:23.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s the money for the night. Can I</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.480" end="01:08:27.560" style="s2">come in now?</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.279" end="01:08:27.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haha. Right this way, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.759" end="01:08:36.799" style="s2">You sleep here. I&#39;ll take the guest</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.679" end="01:08:39.799" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.799" end="01:08:39.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.880" end="01:08:49.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; wa. What the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.359" end="01:08:51.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you like touching abs. So, I</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.520" end="01:08:55.920" style="s2">just wanted to ask you, how&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.359" end="01:08:59.560" style="s2">sleep? You want to sleep on my abs?</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.920" end="01:08:59.560" style="s2">I never said that.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.880" end="01:09:09.880" style="s2">Actually,</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.400" end="01:09:26.960" style="s2">if you want to kiss me, actually,</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.199" end="01:09:31.560" style="s2">you can just do it in the open.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.960" end="01:09:31.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help. This man is way too tempting.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.920" end="01:09:36.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no. For elements are void.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.359" end="01:09:51.040" style="s2">Sis-in-law. It&#39;s bad.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.640" end="01:09:52.159" style="s2">My bro got in trouble. What? What</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.040" end="01:09:53.440" style="s2">happened to Hanjo? Don&#39;t tell me that</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.159" end="01:09:55.760" style="s2">girlfriend of his. She moved up the</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.440" end="01:09:57.360" style="s2">whole cutting out his kidney thing. My</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.760" end="01:09:59.360" style="s2">broke air got a call from that</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.360" end="01:10:00.320" style="s2">girlfriend of his and then he bolted</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.360" end="01:10:02.800" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.320" end="01:10:07.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.800" end="01:10:07.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. Hurry. Let&#39;s save him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.000" end="01:10:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come closer. Guiu, don&#39;t you come</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.719" end="01:10:18.400" style="s2">closer.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.640" end="01:10:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe, you used to call me your little</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.400" end="01:10:22.640" style="s2">sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.320" end="01:10:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know you were a guy back then.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.640" end="01:10:28.320" style="s2">You&#39;re just a cute little thing. You and</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.280" end="01:10:30.640" style="s2">I could never happen.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.320" end="01:10:32.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.640" end="01:10:35.280" style="s2">Since we can&#39;t be together, then I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.640" end="01:10:39.280" style="s2">need you as a person anymore. Just give</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.280" end="01:10:41.440" style="s2">me your kidney and your eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.280" end="01:10:45.400" style="s2">You two hurry up any later and shine and</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.440" end="01:10:45.400" style="s2">eyes will be gone for good.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.280" end="01:10:53.280" style="s2">Sis-in-law, save me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.280" end="01:10:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.280" end="01:10:56.960" style="s2">Another one coming to die.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.560" end="01:10:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis-in-law. Sis-in-law, save me. Kill</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.960" end="01:11:01.440" style="s2">him. Just you, a woman, all by yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.920" end="01:11:03.520" style="s2">Coming here to die.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.440" end="01:11:06.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m enough on my own.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.520" end="01:11:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big talk. I won&#39;t go easy on you just</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.159" end="01:11:10.880" style="s2">because you&#39;re a woman. If you kneel</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.400" end="01:11:15.840" style="s2">down and apologize now, I might let you</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.880" end="01:11:17.760" style="s2">off this once. Oh, and if I don&#39;t kneel,</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.840" end="01:11:20.159" style="s2">then I&#39;ll gouge at your eyes and send</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.760" end="01:11:21.784" style="s2">you</p>
