<p begin="01:11:47.360" end="01:11:51.320" style="s2">your eyes and take a look?</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.320" end="01:12:05.760" style="s2">Judge you, bro. Save me. Save me. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.199" end="01:12:09.960" style="s2">Hurry. This Liyu, he&#39;s just a total</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.760" end="01:12:09.960" style="s2">sweetheart. Pure sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.320" end="01:12:16.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re threatening me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.320" end="01:12:18.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you even know who I am? Be smart and</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.239" end="01:12:19.840" style="s2">leave now. Stop getting your nose right.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.320" end="01:12:21.840" style="s2">Ranked third on the bounty list. the</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.840" end="01:12:24.080" style="s2">sweetheart who loves harvesting organs.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.840" end="01:12:26.239" style="s2">So, it&#39;s you. Didn&#39;t expect that to hide</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.080" end="01:12:28.239" style="s2">your identity. You went and got yourself</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.239" end="01:12:29.760" style="s2">a sweetheart makeover. You really spared</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.239" end="01:12:33.120" style="s2">no expense.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.760" end="01:12:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, he&#39;s still a sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.120" end="01:12:37.199" style="s2">Wife, watch out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.880" end="01:12:40.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you know my identity, then all of</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.199" end="01:12:40.840" style="s2">you are dying today.</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.315" end="01:12:46.335" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.719" end="01:12:52.000" style="s2">That&#39;s your idea of a fight? And you</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.400" end="01:12:53.360" style="s2">still dare to threaten my sister-in-law?</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.000" end="01:12:54.000" style="s2">She&#39;s not going to beat him to death, is</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.360" end="01:12:55.840" style="s2">she?</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.000" end="01:12:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, spare his life. Hand it to the</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.840" end="01:13:00.440" style="s2">cops. There&#39;s a 200 grand bounty.</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.440" end="01:13:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.040" end="01:13:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, damn. You&#39;re actually worth a</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.719" end="01:13:05.960" style="s2">pretty penny.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.000" end="01:13:16.239" style="s2">Lady warrior, I already called the</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.760" end="01:13:19.400" style="s2">police. Next. Just just hand him over to</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.239" end="01:13:19.400" style="s2">the cops.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.640" end="01:13:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch out,</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.880" end="01:13:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; bro.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.000" end="01:13:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you stupid?</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.120" end="01:13:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, man. Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.640" end="01:13:40.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. It&#39;s not that deep</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.320" end="01:13:44.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; with that scrawny little body of yours.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.159" end="01:13:44.360" style="s2">You still jumped in front of me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.880" end="01:13:51.440" style="s2">I was worried about you. Okay. What if</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.880" end="01:13:52.000" style="s2">you got hurt? I can&#39;t afford to pay for</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.440" end="01:13:54.000" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.000" end="01:13:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Figures. You really are one stingy</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.000" end="01:13:56.800" style="s2">cheapkate.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.520" end="01:13:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law, get into the hospital to</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.800" end="01:13:59.840" style="s2">patch up that wound. When the cops get</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.400" end="01:14:04.199" style="s2">here, I&#39;ll go see.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.840" end="01:14:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll leave this to you then.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.560" end="01:14:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Luly. I got stabbed in the stomach,</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.960" end="01:14:10.320" style="s2">not the leg. Is carrying me really</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.360" end="01:14:12.719" style="s2">necessary?</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.320" end="01:14:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. There are so many people here</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.719" end="01:14:16.719" style="s2">carrying me like this. I&#39;m losing face.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.920" end="01:14:19.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.719" end="01:14:19.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.679" end="01:14:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow. So, you do feel pain, huh? And you</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.920" end="01:14:30.800" style="s2">still jumped in front of me? You knew I</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.600" end="01:14:33.280" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t get hurt. What a waste. Such</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.800" end="01:14:35.120" style="s2">nice abs.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.280" end="01:14:36.080" style="s2">If they scar up, that would be such a</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.120" end="01:14:40.306" style="s2">shame.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.080" end="01:14:40.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They won&#39;t scar. Ah. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.760" end="01:14:50.159" style="s2">I&#39;m saying if you like them, I won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.120" end="01:14:52.080" style="s2">them scar.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.159" end="01:14:54.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does he even mean by that? Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.080" end="01:14:56.880" style="s2">tell me he&#39;s got a thing for me. Hold</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.719" end="01:14:59.199" style="s2">up. What are you saying? I am not his</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.880" end="01:15:01.360" style="s2">little darling. [snorts] At most, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.199" end="01:15:03.440" style="s2">just your body</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.360" end="01:15:06.440" style="s2">that I have a tiny bit of appreciation</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.440" end="01:15:06.440" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.040" end="01:15:11.840" style="s2">What kind of man do you like? Or rather,</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.239" end="01:15:14.880" style="s2">what do you want your future husband to</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.840" end="01:15:16.320" style="s2">be like? Whatever you want, I&#39;ll do my</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.880" end="01:15:18.159" style="s2">best to be that.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.320" end="01:15:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.159" end="01:15:23.600" style="s2">forget it. I like you. Stay the hell</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.480" end="01:15:25.679" style="s2">away from me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.600" end="01:15:28.159" style="s2">Tall and handsome, sure, but this girl</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.679" end="01:15:31.199" style="s2">ain&#39;t into little darlings.</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.159" end="01:15:32.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not? I&#39;m your husband for crying out</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.199" end="01:15:35.600" style="s2">loud.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.560" end="01:15:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Truth is, I&#39;m a cultivator. I&#39;m supposed</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.600" end="01:15:40.159" style="s2">to cultivate my mind in nature. Romance</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.920" end="01:15:42.239" style="s2">isn&#39;t for me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.159" end="01:15:43.840" style="s2">The real truth, my heart is sealed in</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.239" end="01:15:45.440" style="s2">concrete.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.840" end="01:15:48.440" style="s2">This girl can&#39;t stomach the pain of</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.440" end="01:15:48.440" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.120" end="01:15:57.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, can you stomach it now?</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.400" end="01:15:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can stomach anything. Anything at all.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.360" end="01:16:02.159" style="s2">I sealed my heart off from love, but not</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.440" end="01:16:05.840" style="s2">completely. A rich, doineering CEO can</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.159" end="01:16:05.840" style="s2">unlock it with a bank card.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.480" end="01:16:14.040" style="s2">Wait, no.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.239" end="01:16:19.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know what I&#39;m thinking?</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.800" end="01:16:22.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually,</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.199" end="01:16:24.159" style="s2">I can hear your inner thoughts.</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.640" end="01:16:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to be kidding me. I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.159" end="01:16:28.719" style="s2">cultivating for years and I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.840" end="01:16:30.880" style="s2">once heard of such a heaven-deying spell</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.719" end="01:16:34.320" style="s2">in this world. Did Shin Junua hit his</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.880" end="01:16:37.280" style="s2">head when he got hurt earlier? Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.320" end="01:16:38.880" style="s2">Since you say you can hear my thoughts,</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.280" end="01:16:39.600" style="s2">then tell me right now what am I</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.880" end="01:16:42.239" style="s2">thinking?</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.600" end="01:16:45.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, then. And what if I actually</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.239" end="01:16:45.239" style="s2">can?</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.679" end="01:16:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll just take these cards and give</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.239" end="01:16:53.120" style="s2">them all back to you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.520" end="01:16:53.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want your cards.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.120" end="01:16:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.920" end="01:16:57.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I guess right, you can never bring up</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.600" end="01:17:01.320" style="s2">divorce again.</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.280" end="01:17:01.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.960" end="01:17:14.000" style="s2">Why are you getting so close to me?</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.159" end="01:17:15.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hear it better up close.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.000" end="01:17:19.520" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="01:17:15.360" end="01:17:20.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just heard it in your mind. You said</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.520" end="01:17:22.320" style="s2">you like me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.560" end="01:17:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My heart&#39;s beating this fast. Does that</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.320" end="01:17:28.040" style="s2">mean I really like him?</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.800" end="01:17:28.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop beating.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.040" end="01:17:35.800" style="s2">I guessed right, didn&#39;t I? Wrong. I</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.159" end="01:17:35.800" style="s2">don&#39;t like you at all.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.520" end="01:17:44.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly,</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.679" end="01:17:51.239" style="s2">actually,</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.760" end="01:17:51.239" style="s2">I like you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.560" end="01:17:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luly, get the hell out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.040" end="01:18:03.600" style="s2">Dad, please show my wife some respect.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.920" end="01:18:04.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s for your own good.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.600" end="01:18:07.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily is a good person.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.640" end="01:18:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s no good for you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.760" end="01:18:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time and last time, our perfectly</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.480" end="01:18:13.840" style="s2">good family. Look what she&#39;s ruined it</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.000" end="01:18:15.840" style="s2">into. And you still defend her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.840" end="01:18:17.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This has nothing to do with Luli. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.840" end="01:18:17.600" style="s2">all because of that bastard son of</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.120" end="01:18:20.640" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.600" end="01:18:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You. Anyway, I will never accept this</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.640" end="01:18:22.880" style="s2">daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.520" end="01:18:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This old geyser is absolutely</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.880" end="01:18:28.719" style="s2">ridiculous. I&#39;ve heard of love needs</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.280" end="01:18:32.000" style="s2">consent, not fathers.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.719" end="01:18:33.760" style="s2">Go to a hospital of sick.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.000" end="01:18:35.760" style="s2">If you&#39;ve got time for this, go get a</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.760" end="01:18:37.280" style="s2">paternity test. That bastard son of</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.760" end="01:18:40.960" style="s2">yours is probably getting restless,</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.280" end="01:18:43.440" style="s2">searching for you to sign.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.960" end="01:18:45.679" style="s2">How did she know that? Au called me</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.440" end="01:18:48.080" style="s2">earlier to meet up. Could what she said</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.679" end="01:18:51.440" style="s2">be true? Impossible. Absolutely</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.080" end="01:18:52.640" style="s2">impossible. You&#39;re cursing me, you jinx.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.440" end="01:18:53.840" style="s2">You just won&#39;t stop until you tear this</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.640" end="01:18:57.280" style="s2">family apart. Will you</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.840" end="01:18:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tearing it? Absurd.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.280" end="01:19:00.080" style="s2">You old mouth. You&#39;re blaming this on</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.800" end="01:19:01.760" style="s2">me, too. Did I tell you to go have a</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.080" end="01:19:03.679" style="s2">bastard son? Did I tell you to go cheat?</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.760" end="01:19:05.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This has nothing to do with Luly. On the</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.679" end="01:19:06.320" style="s2">contrary, she saved me time and time</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.040" end="01:19:08.560" style="s2">again. Did she feed you some kind of</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.320" end="01:19:10.480" style="s2">love potion or what? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.560" end="01:19:13.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You old bastard. Do you have a death</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.480" end="01:19:13.480" style="s2">wish?</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.840" end="01:19:17.920" style="s2">A death wish? A death wish? A death</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.000" end="01:19:20.719" style="s2">wish? [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.920" end="01:19:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, just go get a paternity test. That</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.719" end="01:19:24.880" style="s2">bastard&#39;s son isn&#39;t even yours.</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.520" end="01:19:26.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.880" end="01:19:30.880" style="s2">A looks so much like me. How could he</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.960" end="01:19:35.120" style="s2">not be my own flesh and blood?</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.880" end="01:19:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Au, I&#39;ve had enough of Shin Jun Way.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.120" end="01:19:42.520" style="s2">Tonight, I&#39;m going to kill him for sure.</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.840" end="01:19:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Au, is that name just a coincidence?</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.719" end="01:19:48.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, that Au is nothing but bad news.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.760" end="01:19:51.440" style="s2">All he wants is our shun group shares.</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.159" end="01:19:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not true. Ao is pure-hearted.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.440" end="01:19:54.880" style="s2">He&#39;s not that kind of person.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.280" end="01:19:56.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether he&#39;s pure-hearted or not, I</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.880" end="01:19:58.239" style="s2">don&#39;t know. But you&#39;re definitely an</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.560" end="01:20:00.960" style="s2">idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.239" end="01:20:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh. Oh. Oh. You actually trust that</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.960" end="01:20:06.239" style="s2">bastard child so much. Fine. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.000" end="01:20:07.920" style="s2">divorcing you right now. You leave with</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.239" end="01:20:08.800" style="s2">nothing. Get the hell out of this house</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.920" end="01:20:10.640" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.800" end="01:20:11.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you have to push me like this?</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.640" end="01:20:14.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.520" end="01:20:16.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll go. Don&#39;t you dare regret</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.640" end="01:20:18.640" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.719" end="01:20:21.360" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.640" end="01:20:22.880" style="s2">you did this on purpose to kick Dad out.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.360" end="01:20:24.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t be a thief forever, but you</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.880" end="01:20:26.880" style="s2">can&#39;t guard against one forever either.</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.719" end="01:20:28.640" style="s2">I know that old bastard too well. Once</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.880" end="01:20:30.080" style="s2">he&#39;s kicked out, he&#39;ll definitely go</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.640" end="01:20:31.440" style="s2">find that bastard child. All we have to</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.080" end="01:20:33.280" style="s2">do is follow him, and we&#39;ll definitely</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.440" end="01:20:36.000" style="s2">find where that bastard child is hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.280" end="01:20:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure enough, the older the ginger, the</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.000" end="01:20:40.505" style="s2">spicier.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.920" end="01:20:42.525" style="s2">What a brilliant move.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.505" end="01:20:42.525" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.800" end="01:20:50.880" style="s2">Why are you looking at me? Answer it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.800" end="01:20:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior, didn&#39;t you want to know who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.880" end="01:20:56.800" style="s2">behind all this? Come to me. I can tell</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.640" end="01:20:58.480" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.800" end="01:21:03.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way, this is your favorite</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.480" end="01:21:03.239" style="s2">coffee. Have a taste.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.239" end="01:21:08.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guin, don&#39;t pull these little tricks on</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.800" end="01:21:10.880" style="s2">me again. I came here for one reason</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.880" end="01:21:11.440" style="s2">only, to find out who&#39;s really behind</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.880" end="01:21:14.000" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.440" end="01:21:16.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junway, you got me all wrong. Did Luly</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.000" end="01:21:19.040" style="s2">say something to you? Don&#39;t believe her.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.880" end="01:21:20.400" style="s2">She&#39;s lying to you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.040" end="01:21:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to stir up drama between</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.400" end="01:21:25.280" style="s2">me and Luli. Gucci Yin, do you actually</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.800" end="01:21:28.400" style="s2">think your little schemes are flawless?</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.280" end="01:21:32.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do anything, Jun Way. She&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.400" end="01:21:32.040" style="s2">Luli at all.</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.280" end="01:21:40.000" style="s2">Sister-in-law, she&#39;s trying to turn you</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.280" end="01:21:42.400" style="s2">against my brother again. Your brother</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.000" end="01:21:44.640" style="s2">won&#39;t believe her. Hey, where&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.400" end="01:21:46.960" style="s2">Shinhano? How come I don&#39;t see him</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.640" end="01:21:50.440" style="s2">anywhere? My big brother sent him to</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.960" end="01:21:50.440" style="s2">tail my dad.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.159" end="01:22:03.440" style="s2">Find a way to stall Shinjuna for me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.520" end="01:22:06.920" style="s2">I need to force that old bastard to sign</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.440" end="01:22:06.920" style="s2">the share agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.520" end="01:22:14.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it. They&#39;re just trying to</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.520" end="01:22:14.800" style="s2">stall Shen Junu.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.639" end="01:22:25.760" style="s2">I did some digging. Luli was always</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.199" end="01:22:27.600" style="s2">sickly and never knew martial arts. She</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.760" end="01:22:30.080" style="s2">faked her identity to get close to you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.600" end="01:22:32.800" style="s2">It has to be for the Shin group.</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.080" end="01:22:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what about you? What&#39;s your angle in</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.800" end="01:22:36.480" style="s2">getting close to me?</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.880" end="01:22:38.239" style="s2">The Shinshares.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.480" end="01:22:41.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way. What exactly are you</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.239" end="01:22:43.440" style="s2">implying? Have you forgotten? I was the</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.600" end="01:22:46.320" style="s2">one who saved you back then.</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.440" end="01:22:49.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.320" end="01:22:49.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who sent you to stall me? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.400" end="01:22:58.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That man called Au.</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.960" end="01:23:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no idea what you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.639" end="01:23:05.679" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.480" end="01:23:08.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it seems I guessed right.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.679" end="01:23:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shinjinu, she&#39;s stalling for time. Go</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.159" end="01:23:12.800" style="s2">find your father right now. He&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.520" end="01:23:14.719" style="s2">danger. Haha.</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.800" end="01:23:17.760" style="s2">I reckon by the time you get there,</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.719" end="01:23:20.560" style="s2">it&#39;ll be too late.</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.760" end="01:23:24.440" style="s2">Your father, right about now, has</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.560" end="01:23:24.440" style="s2">probably already signed</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.840" end="01:23:30.320" style="s2">that share transfer agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.639" end="01:23:31.520" style="s2">Whether it&#39;s too late or not, that&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.320" end="01:23:34.480" style="s2">for you to decide.</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.520" end="01:23:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I forgot to tell you. Last month, my</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.480" end="01:23:38.800" style="s2">father already transferred all the</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.760" end="01:23:41.840" style="s2">company&#39;s shares into my name.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.800" end="01:23:42.639" style="s2">Your little scheme dead in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.840" end="01:23:48.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.639" end="01:23:48.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And one more thing. Luly is no stranger.</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.199" end="01:23:55.920" style="s2">She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.159" end="01:23:57.679" style="s2">Dad, you just need to sign right here.</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.920" end="01:23:59.280" style="s2">Mom and I have suffered for so many</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.679" end="01:24:03.800" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.280" end="01:24:03.800" style="s2">You promised you&#39;d make it up to me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.560" end="01:24:13.600" style="s2">If you&#39;ve got time for this, why not go</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.080" end="01:24:14.719" style="s2">get a paternity test instead? That</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.600" end="01:24:16.080" style="s2">bastard child of yours is probably</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.719" end="01:24:17.520" style="s2">losing his mind right now, running</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.080" end="01:24:19.280" style="s2">around like a headless chicken trying to</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.520" end="01:24:21.760" style="s2">get you to sign the share agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.280" end="01:24:24.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ly is what she said true. A really isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.760" end="01:24:25.840" style="s2">my child? All just for the Shing Group</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.320" end="01:24:29.360" style="s2">shares.</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.840" end="01:24:32.239" style="s2">Hey, you are you really my child?</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.360" end="01:24:34.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you already knew.</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.239" end="01:24:36.239" style="s2">So what do you know today? This document</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.560" end="01:24:37.920" style="s2">gets signed whether you like it or not.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.239" end="01:24:40.239" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.920" end="01:24:43.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother, sister-in-law, dad is in this</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.239" end="01:24:43.239" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.080" end="01:24:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.920" end="01:24:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, are you okay? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.040" end="01:24:52.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He got away. I&#39;m going after him.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.040" end="01:24:56.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get to the hospital first. He won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.560" end="01:24:56.679" style="s2">this go. We need to be prepared.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.040" end="01:25:10.239" style="s2">Au, you&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.159" end="01:25:11.920" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I tell you to stall them? How did</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.239" end="01:25:14.000" style="s2">they get here so fast?</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.920" end="01:25:16.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Au, that old bastard already transferred</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.000" end="01:25:17.360" style="s2">the shares.</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.159" end="01:25:20.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.360" end="01:25:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what do we do now? Don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.400" end="01:25:25.760" style="s2">all the scheming was for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.520" end="01:25:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you panicking? Once they&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.760" end="01:25:31.120" style="s2">dead, we forge a paternity test and I</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.520" end="01:25:33.520" style="s2">become the rightful heir to the Shing</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.120" end="01:25:33.520" style="s2">group.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.948" end="01:25:35.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.280" end="01:25:44.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That old fool. I told him that bastard</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.560" end="01:25:46.239" style="s2">has ambitions, but he wouldn&#39;t listen.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.239" end="01:25:47.840" style="s2">Mom, didn&#39;t the doctor say dad will wake</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.239" end="01:25:49.360" style="s2">up in a few days?</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.840" end="01:25:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank god mom forced dad to transfer the</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.360" end="01:25:55.440" style="s2">shares to you, brother. Otherwise, they</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.600" end="01:25:58.440" style="s2">would have gotten away with it.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.440" end="01:25:58.440" style="s2">Luly,</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.040" end="01:26:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.440" end="01:26:07.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you thanking me for,</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.760" end="01:26:11.600" style="s2">sister-in-law? Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.600" end="01:26:13.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good girl. I should thank you, too. Why</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.600" end="01:26:16.280" style="s2">are you all suddenly being so nice to</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.280" end="01:26:16.280" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.719" end="01:26:24.320" style="s2">Luly, thank you for changing my whole</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.760" end="01:26:27.880" style="s2">family&#39;s fate and thank you for showing</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.320" end="01:26:27.880" style="s2">up in my life.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.000" end="01:26:32.040" style="s2">Nothing. I just suddenly feel</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.800" end="01:26:35.679" style="s2">that having you by my side makes me</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.719" end="01:26:39.199" style="s2">pretty happy.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.679" end="01:26:42.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course it does. So, hiring me, money</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.199" end="01:26:44.090" style="s2">well spent, right?</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.070" end="01:26:44.090" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.639" end="01:26:50.159" style="s2">Mom&#39;s not feeling well. I&#39;ll have Ja</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.639" end="01:26:50.800" style="s2">take her home. Hanjo is keeping watch in</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.159" end="01:26:53.360" style="s2">the hospital room.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.800" end="01:26:54.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what do we do next? The killer won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.360" end="01:26:56.560" style="s2">just let this go.</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.719" end="01:26:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The killer probably already knows.</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.560" end="01:27:01.679" style="s2">Forcing dad to sign the share transfer</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.400" end="01:27:05.400" style="s2">was useless. His next move.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.679" end="01:27:05.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I were the killer,</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.760" end="01:27:09.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d go all in.</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.760" end="01:27:13.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.840" end="01:27:25.040" style="s2">You old bastard. You force my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.639" end="01:27:28.159" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll send your whole family</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.040" end="01:27:31.880" style="s2">to reunite in hell real soon. And then</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.159" end="01:27:31.880" style="s2">group will be all mine.</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.960" end="01:27:37.280" style="s2">Doctor,</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.960" end="01:27:40.719" style="s2">when will my dad wake up? The patient is</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.280" end="01:27:42.960" style="s2">recovering well. He&#39;ll wake up tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.719" end="01:27:46.760" style="s2">That&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.960" end="01:27:46.760" style="s2">Thank you doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.880" end="01:27:58.199" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.199" end="01:28:10.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s the killer. Hanjo is in danger.</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.320" end="01:28:11.199" style="s2">Hey, I&#39;ll go after him. You go find your</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.639" end="01:28:14.199" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.199" end="01:28:14.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Louis.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.040" end="01:28:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t worry. With sis-in-law here,</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.639" end="01:28:23.360" style="s2">everything&#39;s going to be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.520" end="01:28:26.239" style="s2">Guccing in. You&#39;ve got some nerves</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.360" end="01:28:29.360" style="s2">showing your face here.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.239" end="01:28:31.199" style="s2">Juja, come on. We were friends at least.</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.360" end="01:28:33.280" style="s2">Why do you have to be so hostile toward</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.199" end="01:28:35.199" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.280" end="01:28:37.360" style="s2">You shameless From the very</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.199" end="01:28:39.760" style="s2">start. You got close to me on purpose</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.360" end="01:28:43.840" style="s2">just to help that bastard. steal our</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.760" end="01:28:46.719" style="s2">Shin family fortune. Ha, that so-called</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.840" end="01:28:49.280" style="s2">bastard of the Shin family isn&#39;t even my</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.719" end="01:28:51.440" style="s2">father&#39;s flesh and blood. That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.280" end="01:28:53.840" style="s2">Not only that, I&#39;m the one who poisoned</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.440" end="01:28:55.840" style="s2">your brother&#39;s medicine. If Luly hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.840" end="01:28:59.960" style="s2">shown up out of nowhere, I should have</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.840" end="01:28:59.960" style="s2">been the one marrying your brother.</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.000" end="01:29:06.480" style="s2">As long as the reporters catch us</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.840" end="01:29:08.880" style="s2">together, he&#39;ll have no choice but to</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.480" end="01:29:12.199" style="s2">marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.880" end="01:29:12.199" style="s2">June away.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.600" end="01:29:37.760" style="s2">If I had successfully married your</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.280" end="01:29:40.080" style="s2">brother, a and I would have killed you</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.760" end="01:29:42.400" style="s2">all long ago</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.080" end="01:29:44.639" style="s2">and taken the Shin family fortune. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.400" end="01:29:47.360" style="s2">all that little Lou&#39;s fault for</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.639" end="01:29:49.440" style="s2">ruining my plan.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.360" end="01:29:52.159" style="s2">So I framed her. said. She pushed me</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.440" end="01:29:54.960" style="s2">down the stairs,</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.159" end="01:29:58.719" style="s2">made every one of you believe</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.960" end="01:30:01.280" style="s2">she was the bad guy.</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.719" end="01:30:05.880" style="s2">Juna and I truly love each other, Luly.</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.280" end="01:30:05.880" style="s2">Just divorce him and let us be together.</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.719" end="01:30:15.199" style="s2">You, it really was you who set up my</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.719" end="01:30:17.040" style="s2">sister-in-law. All the horrible things</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.199" end="01:30:18.480" style="s2">you&#39;ve done, you&#39;ll get what&#39;s coming to</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.040" end="01:30:24.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.480" end="01:30:28.360" style="s2">Let go of Jeda. Let her go, Jeda.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.880" end="01:30:28.360" style="s2">Take her away.</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.760" end="01:30:47.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Air G, wake up both of you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.000" end="01:30:50.320" style="s2">Jeda Hanjo, are you two okay? Mom, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.840" end="01:30:53.679" style="s2">fine. Brother and sister-in-law will</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.320" end="01:30:55.920" style="s2">definitely come save us.</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.679" end="01:30:58.000" style="s2">Save you. Don&#39;t kid yourself. Your</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.920" end="01:31:00.800" style="s2">sister-in-law, Luly, she can barely save</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.000" end="01:31:05.080" style="s2">herself right now. As for your brother,</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.800" end="01:31:05.080" style="s2">he&#39;ll be joining you soon enough.</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.120" end="01:31:13.199" style="s2">He took Hanjo just to threaten me. He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.440" end="01:31:14.159" style="s2">reach out to me. Let&#39;s go home and wait</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.199" end="01:31:17.159" style="s2">for news.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.159" end="01:31:17.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.760" end="01:31:26.840" style="s2">Junway, Miss Lou, long time no see.</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.280" end="01:31:26.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guin Yin,</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.760" end="01:31:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; take them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.840" end="01:31:40.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She took Jeda and your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.719" end="01:31:50.080" style="s2">Hello, Shin Juni. Your mother and your</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.600" end="01:31:52.080" style="s2">brother and sister are all in my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.080" end="01:31:54.080" style="s2">If you don&#39;t want them dead, come find</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.080" end="01:31:56.239" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.080" end="01:31:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su, it really is you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.239" end="01:32:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I don&#39;t see you within 10 minutes,</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.760" end="01:32:04.080" style="s2">they all die. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.520" end="01:32:07.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.080" end="01:32:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad for you, too. Today, only one of</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.360" end="01:32:11.520" style="s2">you get to leave your life.</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.520" end="01:32:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean? You go save them.</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.520" end="01:32:12.880" style="s2">Leave this to me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.480" end="01:32:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.880" end="01:32:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already had assistantly called the</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.000" end="01:32:17.120" style="s2">cops. Go stall for time. You have to</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.440" end="01:32:19.920" style="s2">wait for me to get there. Remember, do</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.120" end="01:32:23.040" style="s2">not let yourself get hurt. Shin Junway.</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.920" end="01:32:25.679" style="s2">On one side, your flesh and blood. On</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.040" end="01:32:28.639" style="s2">the other, the woman you love most. How</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.679" end="01:32:32.679" style="s2">will you choose? Don&#39;t worry. They&#39;re no</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.639" end="01:32:32.679" style="s2">match for me. Go.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.280" end="01:32:43.280" style="s2">Luly, did you see that? No matter how</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.400" end="01:32:45.440" style="s2">sweet his words sound, you will never be</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.280" end="01:32:47.920" style="s2">on the same level as his family. He can</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.440" end="01:32:50.159" style="s2">dump you without a second thought. And</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.920" end="01:32:51.840" style="s2">what about you? You&#39;re helping Sia do</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.159" end="01:32:54.000" style="s2">his dirty work. Are you really so sure</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.840" end="01:32:56.480" style="s2">his feelings for you are real? He&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.000" end="01:32:58.800" style="s2">using you to get his hands on the Shin</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.480" end="01:33:01.360" style="s2">family fortune. Shut up. What do you</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.800" end="01:33:05.760" style="s2">know? A West feelings for me are real.</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.360" end="01:33:07.760" style="s2">We grew up together. Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.760" end="01:33:10.320" style="s2">Luly, I know you&#39;ve got some tricks up</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.760" end="01:33:12.800" style="s2">your sleeve, but everyone I brought</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.320" end="01:33:13.840" style="s2">today is a pro.</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.800" end="01:33:16.159" style="s2">There&#39;s no way you&#39;re getting out of</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.840" end="01:33:18.960" style="s2">this. But don&#39;t worry, I&#39;ll send Shin</p>
<p begin="01:33:16.159" end="01:33:23.440" style="s2">Junway down to join you. You too can be</p>
<p begin="01:33:18.960" end="01:33:26.760" style="s2">a pair of starcrossed lovers in hell.</p>
<p begin="01:33:23.440" end="01:33:26.760" style="s2">Get them.</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.199" end="01:33:41.239" style="s2">Don&#39;t come any closer. You you you a</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.239" end="01:33:41.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sudden</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.880" end="01:33:46.159" style="s2">hon</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.639" end="01:33:48.560" style="s2">you finally showed up.</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.159" end="01:33:49.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them go. Whatever you want, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.560" end="01:33:53.000" style="s2">give it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.520" end="01:33:53.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them go.</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.159" end="01:33:59.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jedia,</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.480" end="01:34:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; why should I? I&#39;m a Shin, too. Why can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.679" end="01:34:03.360" style="s2">I have the Shin group?</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.040" end="01:34:04.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying. You&#39;re not a Shin at all.</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.360" end="01:34:06.000" style="s2">Guing told us everything. All the</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.880" end="01:34:07.280" style="s2">horrible things you&#39;ve done. You</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.000" end="01:34:08.800" style="s2">pretended to be a goo to get close to my</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.280" end="01:34:10.719" style="s2">dad, then drugged my brother so you</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.800" end="01:34:13.280" style="s2">could marry him and kill him. All to</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.719" end="01:34:14.800" style="s2">steal our family&#39;s fortune. You people</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.280" end="01:34:17.440" style="s2">are despicable.</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.800" end="01:34:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So all of this was Guing&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.440" end="01:34:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all that Guingians fault. She</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.000" end="01:34:26.320" style="s2">made me wrongly accuse my sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.520" end="01:34:28.159" style="s2">So what? I called him dad for years. He</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.320" end="01:34:30.880" style="s2">said himself. He would hand the shing</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.159" end="01:34:33.280" style="s2">group over to me. He made a promise. So</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.880" end="01:34:35.440" style="s2">the shing group belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:33.280" end="01:34:38.320" style="s2">you. What makes you think you deserve</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.440" end="01:34:40.320" style="s2">it? Judge you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.320" end="01:34:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you won&#39;t give it to me, I&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.320" end="01:34:43.120" style="s2">take it myself.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.400" end="01:34:45.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ja.</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.120" end="01:34:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you&#39;re all dead,</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.199" end="01:34:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; no one will be left fighting for it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.639" end="01:34:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let Ja go.</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.760" end="01:34:53.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come [snorts] any closer. Teach</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.920" end="01:34:53.960" style="s2">him a good lesson for me,</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.400" end="01:35:01.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; bro.</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.239" end="01:35:06.560" style="s2">Shin Junway, aren&#39;t you supposed to be</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.800" end="01:35:08.159" style="s2">so tough?</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.560" end="01:35:10.639" style="s2">I went through so much trouble back then</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.159" end="01:35:14.040" style="s2">and you still escaped. Let&#39;s see how you</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.639" end="01:35:14.040" style="s2">escaped today.</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.520" end="01:35:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the Shun group shares? I can</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.760" end="01:35:24.080" style="s2">give them to you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.520" end="01:35:27.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want the Shing group shares and I want</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.080" end="01:35:27.560" style="s2">your life too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.840" end="01:35:34.440" style="s2">Let go of my brother.</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.040" end="01:35:34.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Junior way.</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.520" end="01:35:40.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yo, what did you inject me with?</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.159" end="01:35:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A drug that&#39;ll leave you completely</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.840" end="01:35:47.440" style="s2">paralyzed.</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.360" end="01:35:50.320" style="s2">Picture this. Shing group CEO</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.440" end="01:35:52.931" style="s2">accidentally falls off a cliff. How&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.320" end="01:35:54.951" style="s2">that for a headline?</p>
<p begin="01:35:52.931" end="01:35:54.951" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.000" end="01:36:14.320" style="s2">With just one little push from me,</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.639" end="01:36:19.080" style="s2">you&#39;ll be nothing but ground meat.</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.320" end="01:36:19.080" style="s2">Stop struggling. You can&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.600" end="01:36:23.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis-in-law, help.</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.920" end="01:36:30.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.639" end="01:36:32.080" style="s2">Hey, hey, save me. Hey,</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.159" end="01:36:34.880" style="s2">you finally showed up.</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.080" end="01:36:37.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let Junu go right now. Otherwise, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.880" end="01:36:41.440" style="s2">throw this woman off.</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.199" end="01:36:45.199" style="s2">Luly, you [snorts] Let me go. Au.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.440" end="01:36:46.800" style="s2">Au, save me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.199" end="01:36:49.679" style="s2">Seems your taste in men isn&#39;t all that</p>
<p begin="01:36:46.800" end="01:36:53.440" style="s2">great either.</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.679" end="01:36:57.520" style="s2">Au, save me. I&#39;m so scared. Have you</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.440" end="01:37:00.159" style="s2">forgotten all the years we had together?</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.520" end="01:37:02.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll count to three. If you don&#39;t give</p>
<p begin="01:37:00.159" end="01:37:06.199" style="s2">him back to me, I&#39;ll throw this woman</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.800" end="01:37:06.199" style="s2">off the edge.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.280" end="01:37:12.760" style="s2">Au, just do what she says. Au,</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.040" end="01:37:20.800" style="s2">Ching, I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;m about to get the</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.719" end="01:37:21.920" style="s2">Shing group. How could I give up now? I</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.800" end="01:37:24.480" style="s2">promise you, every year on your death</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.920" end="01:37:25.760" style="s2">anniversary, I&#39;ll come visit you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.480" end="01:37:29.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.760" end="01:37:30.960" style="s2">Au, I&#39;ve done so much for you. Do you</p>
<p begin="01:37:29.360" end="01:37:33.840" style="s2">even have a conscience?</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.960" end="01:37:35.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I force you? You did it all on your</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.840" end="01:37:38.560" style="s2">own.</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.920" end="01:37:40.480" style="s2">Luli, I know you got some tricks up your</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.560" end="01:37:42.639" style="s2">sleeve. Last time you were the one who</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.480" end="01:37:46.159" style="s2">saved Shinjun when he fell from the</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.639" end="01:37:48.159" style="s2">second floor. Now we&#39;re on a cliff.</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.159" end="01:37:52.760" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how you saved him this time.</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.159" end="01:37:52.760" style="s2">Go to hell, Shinjun way.</p>
<p begin="01:37:53.280" end="01:37:56.679" style="s2">June away.</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.679" end="01:38:11.080" style="s2">Mr. Shin</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.378" end="01:38:18.398" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.040" end="01:38:28.168" style="s2">Junua, do you have any idea? If I&#39;d been</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.199" end="01:38:30.188" style="s2">one step later, you&#39;d have.</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.168" end="01:38:30.188" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.280" end="01:38:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.578" end="01:38:44.598" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.880" end="01:38:52.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t think that just because you say</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.320" end="01:38:56.600" style="s2">that I won&#39;t be mad. You promised you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.800" end="01:38:56.600" style="s2">wait for me to come together.</p>
<p begin="01:38:57.520" end="01:39:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it. You would definitely come to</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.320" end="01:39:03.119" style="s2">save me.</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.199" end="01:39:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you so sure?</p>
<p begin="01:39:03.119" end="01:39:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because my fate changed because of you.</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.920" end="01:39:11.639" style="s2">You are my one and only salvation in</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.480" end="01:39:11.639" style="s2">this life.</p>
<p begin="01:39:22.960" end="01:39:26.639" style="s2">Guingen and Sia got what they deserved.</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.040" end="01:39:31.400" style="s2">They faced the loss punishment. Our</p>
<p begin="01:39:26.639" end="01:39:31.400" style="s2">family can finally go back to peace.</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.239" end="01:39:35.679" style="s2">Hey, where&#39;s mom?</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.840" end="01:39:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s upstairs chewing out dad saying if</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.679" end="01:39:39.679" style="s2">he hadn&#39;t gone and made a child, none of</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.080" end="01:39:41.520" style="s2">this would have happened to our family.</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.679" end="01:39:44.159" style="s2">Thank god mom&#39;s health check came back</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.520" end="01:39:46.159" style="s2">totally clean. Thank god we have our</p>
<p begin="01:39:44.159" end="01:39:48.480" style="s2">sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.159" end="01:39:50.880" style="s2">Wait a sec. Why do I feel like big bro</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.480" end="01:39:52.159" style="s2">is scheming on sis-in-law again? No way.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.880" end="01:39:55.280" style="s2">I need a raise.</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.159" end="01:40:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done. I&#39;ll throw in another 100 million.</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.280" end="01:40:05.760" style="s2">Add to that 17 properties under my name</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.040" end="01:40:09.280" style="s2">plus 40% of Shan Group shares. Sign it.</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.760" end="01:40:11.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re being this generous this time?</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.280" end="01:40:14.760" style="s2">for my own life. Of course, I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.600" end="01:40:14.760" style="s2">be generous.</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.719" end="01:40:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, no. Why does the term on the say a</p>
<p begin="01:40:24.800" end="01:40:26.719" style="s2">lifetime? You want me to work for you</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.000" end="01:40:29.199" style="s2">for a lifetime?</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.719" end="01:40:32.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe, look carefully. I&#39;ve already given</p>
<p begin="01:40:29.199" end="01:40:34.880" style="s2">you all the Shen group shares.</p>
<p begin="01:40:32.560" end="01:40:37.840" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;m the one working for you</p>
<p begin="01:40:34.880" end="01:40:41.400" style="s2">for a lifetime. Oh, Shenzhuna, you dare</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.840" end="01:40:41.400" style="s2">scheme against me?</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
